Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.34,0:00:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对  新皮夹{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey! New wallet, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.89,0:00:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}也该换新的了  里面的安全套终于不再说"好凉快"了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, It was time. The old condom ring in the leather just doesn't say 'cool' anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.77,0:00:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}瑞秋  你把吃剩的空盒子又放回冰箱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Rachel, you just put an empty carton back in the fridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对啊  因为垃圾袋满了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know, but the garbage was full.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你从来没有倒过垃圾吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Have you ever taken out the trash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我以为这是你的爱好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, I thought you liked doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.19,0:00:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}左边第三个门   知道了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Third door on the left. Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.06,0:00:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（垃圾槽）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗨  崔戈先生{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, Mr. Treeger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.25,0:01:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对不起{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}虽然不那么新鲜  不过...{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's a little old but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不是说这个  你堵住了我花半小时才弄通的垃圾道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No! You're clogging up the chute that I spent a half-hour unclogging!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.95,0:01:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真对不起  我不常来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm sorry.  I didn't—I don't come in here a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.24,0:01:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是啊  你当然不常来  因为你是个小公主{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh yeah, of course you don't! 'Cause you're a little princess!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}爸爸  给我买份披萨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Daddy, buy me a pizza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.74,0:01:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}爸爸  给我买个糖果厂{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Daddy, buy me a candy factory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}爸爸  让猫咪们为我唱生日歌{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Daddy, make the cast of Cats sing "Happy Birthday" to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你以为你可以到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You think you can come here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.61,0:01:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}搞得一团糟  反正最后穿工装的大个子会来清扫{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}make a mess and the big man in coveralls will come in here and clean it up, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.65,0:01:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么不替他人多想想  改一改呢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, why don't think of someone else for a change?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哦  我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:02:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}老天  干这么点活你也会哭{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}God, if you're going to cry about it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.73,0:02:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}{\fs19}《老友记》  第四季  第04集  与郎共舞{\r\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Friends S04E04  The one with the ballroom dancing{\r\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}
