Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.92,0:02:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：马特·勒布朗）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：马修·派瑞）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.55,0:02:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：大卫·修蒙）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是崔戈把你弄哭的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Whoa, whoa! Treeger made you cry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.61,0:02:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是啊  他说话相当刻薄  而且并非都是真的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes! And he said really mean things that were only partly true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要下去给那家伙上一课  教训他一下{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm gonna go down there and teach that guy a lesson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔伊  别去  我们最好忘掉这事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Joey, please don't do that. I think it's best that we just forget about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你说的倒轻松  刚才被折磨的又不是你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's easy for you to say. You weren't almost just killed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好的  上课的时间到了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right, that's it. School is in session!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊  这是健身卡吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}My God! Is this a gym card?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哦  没错  健身房会员{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, yeah, gym member.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我原打算每周去四次  但我错过了...{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I try to go four times a week, but I've missed the last...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}最后1200次{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}1200 times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么不退出{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So why don't you quit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.51,0:03:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你以为我没试过吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You don't think I've tried?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你以为他们每月从我帐户上扣掉50块  我很开心吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You think I like having 50 dollars taken out of my bank account every month?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  他们让你到他们那里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, they make you go all the way down there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}然后就运用所有的词语和表情来迷惑你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Then they use all of these phrases and peppiness to try and confuse you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}最后他们推出了玛利亚{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And then they bring out Maria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}玛利亚是谁  哦  玛利亚{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Who is Maria? Oh, Maria!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.11,0:03:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你没有能力拒绝她{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You can't say no to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她就像是用合成弹力纤维包装的健身房的...礼品{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}she's like this lycra spandex covered gym…treat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}要我和你一道去帮你打气吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Do you need me to go with you and hold your hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不用了  那你有勇气单独面对她吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No!  So you're strong enough to face her on your own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.09,0:04:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  你还是来吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh no, you'll have to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.45,0:04:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}崔比亚尼  等一下{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Tribbiani. Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我去拿皮揣子 (通马桶用){\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'll get the plunger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.55,0:04:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你等一下伙计  你把我朋友瑞秋气哭了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You hold on pal! Now you made my friend, Rachel, cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.28,0:04:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你得上去向她道歉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So now, you're gonna go up there and apologize to her...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}否则我就要去找房东了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}unless you want me to call the landlord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}跟他说什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And tell him what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你难道不知道什么叫 "不准让女孩哭泣"吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Have you heard about a little something called "not making girls cry."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.13,0:04:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你也许听过1968年发布的《租屋安定法案》吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah. Well maybe you have heard about the Rent Stabilization Act of 1968!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.89,0:04:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}说实话  我还真的没听过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I have actually not heard of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你朋友触犯了这个法案{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, well your friends are in violation of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我一直没出声  不过现在我不用再做好人了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I've been a nice guy up until now, but, I don't need this grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要去告诉房东{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm gonna call the landlord...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}把莫妮卡外婆的房子转租给她  是非法的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}and tell him that Monica is illegally subletting here grandmother's apartment.{\r}
